# Never commit credentials. chief itself holds no MCP configuration and writes no key: the agent
# CLIs keep their tokens in their own folders (~/.claude, ~/.codex, …), which are outside this
# repository. These patterns are a guard for anything a person adds by hand while developing.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
credentials.json

